            "detailed_description": "<h1>Nova atualização</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547870/extras/58d779cd7b679b88c78034f83dff1921.avif?t=1776497943\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><br>Hello. My name is Rodrigo and I am the developer of Clown2Beat. I know you are here to play and have some fun. But let me show you my new game project called Parallel. The main character is a clown, I started this project on Jnauary 2020. With your support I will finish this game. Let me know what you think and have fun playing my games. Thanks<br><br>Website: </p><br><h1>Novo DLC disponível</h1><p>Now you can play a complete version with 30 levels. Take a look: </p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547870/extras/45e1b3179eb5eeb9bea686af935b2477.avif?t=1776497943\" width=600 height=78 /></span><br><br>Open the doors and beat the Clowns, solving the challenges before the clock ends. <br><br>You are selected to be part of a circus, your mission is to unlock all the doors winning prizes during your adventure. But for that, you need to beat all the clowns in each door to unlock the next one. Some of the phases has big challenges to solve. Attention to the number of lives and time remaining to complete each phase. Welcome to Clown2Beat game.<br><br>Message from the Clowns: &quot;<i>We are working on more rooms for you buddy, so keep an eye in this game and soon we will have more levels, adventures and improvements.</i>&quot;<br><br>Thanks for your support.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/547870/extras/45e1b3179eb5eeb9bea686af935b2477.avif?t=1776497943\" width=600 height=78 /></span><br><br>Open the doors and beat the Clowns, solving the challenges before the clock ends. <br><br>You are selected to be part of a circus, your mission is to unlock all the doors winning prizes during your adventure. But for that, you need to beat all the clowns in each door to unlock the next one. Some of the phases has big challenges to solve. Attention to the number of lives and time remaining to complete each phase. Welcome to Clown2Beat game.<br><br>Message from the Clowns: &quot;<i>We are working on more rooms for you buddy, so keep an eye in this game and soon we will have more levels, adventures and improvements.</i>&quot;<br><br>Thanks for your support.",
